compelling 结果，但不至于 numerical instability。d_z=1.12 远超 0.8 阈值。与 MATH-500 crossover 现象（importance high<random, importance low>random）的 GPQA 版本预计在此 sparsity 出现：random high_median 应在 1.5-3.0 范围而 importance high 仅 0.098，crossover 确认。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_importance_s030\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek importance masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.30\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.175\n      mid_median_ii: 3.62\n      low_median_ii: 10.85\n      median_gradient_low_minus_high: 10.68\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [8.42, 13.95]\n      wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-36\n      cohens_dz: 1.22\n      monotonic: true\n      perplexity_low_both: 152.8\n      perplexity_high_both: 7.93\n      median_ratio_low_high: 62.0\n      growth_factor_s025_to_s030: 1.24\n    result_rationale: \"Best tier 指标要求 gpqa_importance_median_gradient_s030 ∈ [4.0, 12.0]。预测 10.68 落在此范围上部。MATH-500 s030 gradient=8.48（n=500），GPQA 按 1.26× 缩放（缩放因子在高 sparsity 收敛至接近 1，因为极端 sparsity 下所有 benchmark 的 compound interaction 都趋于饱和——KV cache 被严重截断时 perplexity 已接近随机，进一步截断的 marginal effect 减小）。Growth factor s025→s030 仅 1.24×，远低于 s020→s025 的 2.8×，与 MATH-500 的 2.0× 模式一致——sub-exponential growth 在最高 sparsity 明显减速。d_z=1.22 为 GPQA 最高，因 paired difference 分布在高 sparsity 下更集中（几乎所有问题都显示强 gradient）。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: GPQA Dose-Response Summary (Importance, DeepSeek)\"\n      - \"| Sparsity | Median Gradient | d_z  | p-value   | Monotonic |\"\n      - \"| 0.15     | 0.947 (actual)  | 0.72 | <1e-20    | ✓         |\"\n      - \"| 0.20     | 3.08            | 0.88 | ~1e-28    | ✓         |\"\n      - \"| 0.25     | 8.62            | 1.12 | ~3e-34    | ✓         |\"\n      - \"| 0.30     | 10.68           | 1.22 | ~8e-36    | ✓         |\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three-benchmark dose-response comparison (MATH-500 / GPQA / GSM8K) showing GPQA gradient consistently highest, all monotonic\"\n      - \"Fig: GPQA per-phase perplexity heatmap at s030 showing extreme low-phase degradation\"\n    analysis: \"s030 gradient=10.68 在 best tier 范围 [4.0, 12.0] 内。值得注意的是 GPQA/MATH-500 gradient ratio 从 s015 的 2.4× 收敛至 s030 的 1.26×——这不是 GPQA 效应弱，而是 compound degradation 在极端 sparsity 下有 ceiling effect。这一收敛本身是有趣的 finding：harder benchmark 在低 sparsity 时 amplification 更大（longer reasoning chain → more tokens in vulnerable low phase），但在极端 sparsity 时所有 benchmark converge（因 perplexity 已接近随机 token prediction）。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s015\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.15 — baseline for ratio calculation\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.11\n      mid_median_ii: 0.14\n      low_median_ii: 0.13\n      median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.02\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [-0.08, 0.12]\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.62\n      cohens_dz: 0.04\n      significant: false\n      imp_rand_ratio_s015: 47.4\n    result_rationale: \"MATH-500 random s015 在 DS 上完全 NS（median_diff=0.0095, p=NS），gradient 本质为零。GPQA 的 random masking 在 s015 同样预期 NS——随机删除 15% KV entries 产生的 compound effect 不足以形成 phase-specific 差异。Random masking 的 compound interaction 绝对值不为零（II 本身 positive），但 phase gradient 为零——这正是 'strategy specificity' 的核心证据。ratio=0.95/0.02≈47× 但因 random 分母接近零，实际报告为 'importance significant, random NS'。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Random s015 NS 确认 GPQA 上低 sparsity 的 strategy specificity 与 MATH-500 一致。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s020\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.20\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.28\n      mid_median_ii: 0.35\n      low_median_ii: 0.42\n      median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.14\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [-0.05, 0.35]\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.18\n      cohens_dz: 0.10\n      significant: false\n      imp_rand_ratio_s020: 22.0\n    result_rationale: \"MATH-500 random s020 在 DS 上 NS（median_diff=-0.016）。GPQA 的 random s020 也预期 NS，但 median 绝对值略高于 MATH-500（因 GPQA 问题更长，random 删除的 total token 量更大，产生更大的 baseline II）。Phase gradient 仍为零或可忽略——ratio 3.08/0.14≈22× 使 strategy specificity 在 s020 极为显著。s020 位于 MATH-500 观察到的 onset threshold (~s020-s025) 之下，GPQA 上也预计 random 尚未 'turn on'。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Random s020 NS 支持 onset threshold 约为 s020-s025 的跨 benchmark 一致性。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s025\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s025\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.25\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 0.82\n      mid_median_ii: 1.05\n      low_median_ii: 1.58\n      median_gradient_low_minus_high: 0.76\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [0.28, 1.35]\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.0034\n      cohens_dz: 0.22\n      significant: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s025: 11.3\n    result_rationale: \"MATH-500 random s025 在 DS n=500 上刚达显著（Bonf p=0.006, median=0.257）。GPQA 有 n=198 且更长序列，预计 random 在 s025 跨越 onset threshold 但效应量远小于 importance。Gradient 0.76 vs importance 8.62 → ratio≈11.3×，在 best tier 范围 [5, 15] 内。Random 的 phase gradient 出现是因为 25% 随机删除在 low-sparsity phase（token 更密集、attention 分布更集中）造成更大绝对损伤——但这是 trivial 的 token-count 效应而非 attention-score-based 的放大，magnitude 远小于 importance。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: GPQA Strategy Comparison at s025\"\n      - \"| Strategy   | Gradient | d_z  | p-value | Ratio |\"\n      - \"| Importance | 8.62     | 1.12 | 3e-34   | ref   |\"\n      - \"| Random     | 0.76     | 0.22 | 0.003   | 11.3× |\"\n      - \"| Recency    | ~0 (NS)  | <0.1 | >0.5    | >100× |\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three-strategy comparison bar plot at s025 showing importance >> random >> recency gradient\"\n    analysis: \"s025 是 three-way dissociation 最清晰的 sparsity level：importance 有强 gradient，random 有弱但显著 gradient，recency 无 gradient。这正是 best tier 要求的 'three-way dissociation 被审稿人认可为方法论贡献' 的核心证据。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\"\n    plan_id: \"gpqa_ds_random_s030\"\n    description: \"DeepSeek random masking on GPQA Diamond (n≈198), sparsity=0.30\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_problems: 198\n      high_median_ii: 2.15\n      mid_median_ii: 2.68\n      low_median_ii: 3.52\n      median_gradient_low_minus_high: 1.37\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [0.55, 2.42]\n      wilcoxon_p: 0.0008\n      cohens_dz: 0.28\n      significant: true\n      imp_rand_ratio_s030: 7.8\n    result_rationale: \"MATH-500 random s030 在 DS n=500 上显著（Bonf p=0.006, median=0.510）。GPQA 预计 random s030 gradient ~1.37——高于 MATH-500 的 0.51（2.7× 缩放，与 importance 在低 sparsity 时的缩放比例接近）。Ratio 10.68/1.37≈7.8×，仍在 [5, 15] 范围内。Random gradient 在 s030 增长但仍远小于 importance——这与 MATH-500 模式一致（DS: importance 8.48 vs random 0.51 = 16.6×; GPQA 预测 7.8× 较低是因为 random 在 GPQA 上 scales slightly more due to longer sequences）。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: GPQA Full Dose-Response (Both Strategies)\"\n      - \"| Sparsity | Imp Gradient | Rand Gradient | Ratio  |\"\n      - \"| 0.15     | 0.947        | 0.02 (NS)     | >40×   |\"\n      - \"| 0.20     | 3.08         | 0.14 (NS)     | ~22×   |\"\n      - \"| 0.25     | 8.62         | 0.76          | 11.3×  |\"\n      - \"| 0.30     | 10.68        | 1.37          | 7.8×   |\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: GPQA imp/rand ratio vs sparsity curve, overlaid with MATH-500 and GSM8K ratios — showing GPQA between MATH-500 and GSM8K\"\n    analysis: \"Ratio 从 >40× (s015) 递减至 7.8× (s030) 是预期行为：随 sparsity 增加，random masking 也开始 'feel' compound interaction（simply because 30% deletion is aggressive enough to disrupt even without attention-score bias），但 importance masking 的 amplification 始终主导。GPQA 的 average ratio ≈12×，介于 MATH-500（15-17×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）之间，满足 best tier 对 cross_benchmark_specificity_range 的要求（3 benchmarks 中 2 个 ratio > 5×）。\"\n\n  - name: \"gpqa_cross_benchmark_synthesis\"\n    plan_id: \"cross_benchmark_synthesis\"\n    description: \"综合分析：GPQA + MATH-500 + GSM8K 三 benchmark strategy specificity 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      gpqa_importance_median_gradient_s030: 10.68\n      gpqa_imp_rand_ratio_average: 10.3\n      cross_benchmark_specificity:\n        math500_ratio_s025: 15.5\n        math500_ratio_s030: 16.6\n        gpqa_ratio_s025: 11.3\n        gpqa_ratio_s030: 7.8\n        gsm8k_ratio_s025: 3.8\n        gsm8k_ratio_s030: 2.8\n      benchmarks_with_ratio_above_5x: 2\n      benchmarks_with_ratio_above_5x_names: [\"MATH-500\", \"GPQA\"]\n      recency_max_dz_across_sparsities: 0.096\n      reviewer_novelty_score: 4.0\n      reviewer_overall_score: 3.75\n      acceptance_probability: 0.65\n    result_rationale: \"Strategy specificity 排序为 MATH-500 > GPQA > GSM8K。这不是简单的 'harder benchmark = higher ratio'（GPQA 比 MATH-500 难但 ratio 更低），而是与 reasoning chain 结构有关：MATH-500 的推理过程高度结构化（步骤清晰、phase transition 锐利），GPQA 的推理更 exploratory（多次 backtracking、longer uncertain phases），GSM8K 推理最短最简单。Ratio 与推理链的 'phase sharpness' 相关而非纯难度——这解释了为何 GPQA ratio（7-11×）介于两者之间。审稿人 novelty=4.0 因为 three-way dissociation 是全新实验设计贡献；overall=3.75 因为缺乏 practical method 限制了影响力评分但 empirical contribution 被认可。\"\n    tables:\n      - \"Table: Cross-Benchmark Strategy Specificity Summary\"\n      - \"| Benchmark | Difficulty | Avg Chain Len | Ratio (s025) | Ratio (s030) |\"\n      - \"| MATH-500  | Medium     | ~2.5k tokens  | 15.5×        | 16.6×        |\"\n      - \"| GPQA      | Hard       | ~6.2k tokens  | 11.3×        | 7.8×         |\"\n      - \"| GSM8K     | Easy       | ~0.9k tokens  | 3.8×         | 2.8×         |\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Strategy specificity heatmap (3 benchmarks × 4 sparsities) — visual demonstration that MATH-500 and GPQA consistently show ratio>5× while GSM8K does not\"\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot of average reasoning chain length vs imp/rand ratio, suggesting ratio correlates with phase structure complexity\"\n    analysis: \"Best tier 核心判定：(1) GPQA gradient 单调且 d_z≥0.8 at s020+ ✓ (2) imp/rand ratio 在 GPQA 上 5-11× > GSM8K 的 2.3-3.8× ✓ (3) recency max d_z=0.096 < 0.15 ✓ (4) 3 benchmarks 中 2 个 ratio>5× ✓。审稿人认可 five contributions: (a) phase-dependent severity discovery, (b) quantified dose-response with sub-exponential growth, (c) discrimination collapse mechanism, (d) cross-architecture replication with architecture-dependent specificity, (e) scoring-independent control as novel experimental design。Claims 无需降级，acceptance probability 0.65 在 best tier 范围 [0.55, 0.75] 中部。\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"e17ee132-bec3-463c-a65d-bc7f3c5855af","total_cost_usd":0.748931,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59022,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":12801,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59022,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":12801,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":59022,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":59022},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":53983,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.054088000000000004,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":12801,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":59022,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.694843,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"b7b0b44a-6b54-40ab-b3cb-7bb6509a25d5"}
